{
  "title": "Mullett Lake, July 2026",
  "date": "2026-07-04",
  "location": "Mullett Lake, Northern Michigan",
  "log": "Nine days at the cottage on Mullett Lake, 4 to 12 July. Cruz's first vacation, and the first time he had been in a lake — he took about ten seconds to decide the water was fine and the rest of the week to be talked out of it.\n\nNot a sailing trip. The powerboat did the work, and the best days were the ones where we did not go anywhere in particular.",
